# Normalize line endings in the repository.
#
# Text files are stored with LF in git and checked out as LF, so a line-ending
# change never appears as a whole-file diff. Without this, a file stored with
# CRLF is silently rewritten by any editor that normalizes endings, which makes
# a three-line change look like a full-file rewrite.
# Applied going forward only. Files already stored with CRLF are left as they are
# so that this change does not rewrite files the exporter task must not touch;
# `git add --renormalize .` would convert them when you choose to do that.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending normalized or diffed as text.
*.stp   binary
*.step  binary
*.wasm  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary